        <UserObject label="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Fast Memory access functions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;After being bind to a Memory it provide functionality to access its content as pure byte data, casted to any primitive or standard object, or as a reference to a key from a specific encoding. It keep a limiter set of index and Chunk* in memory through consecutive calls to its function to optimize repeated operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It is not an heavy object and it can be pooled. Still a resonanle amount of instance will be needed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Estimate : 30&amp;nbsp; ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;___________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" tags="" id="hyf4-Oh7LbH0ACKaER-5-65">
